tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/Talk.png?t=1753105783\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Date to Remember</h2>In this game, your soul and Coneru\u2019s, two beings from different dimensions, unite as one. Embark on a special date that you can only experience in this unique 2D action adventure. It\u2019ll be a date you'll never forget!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/NeverForget.png?t=1753105783\" /></div><br><br>We\u2019re still hard at work! Keep an eye out for updates as we continue development.<br>Don\u2019t forget to add to your wishlist and follow us for the latest news!","developers":["HIKE Inc.","Eallin Japan Co.Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/header.jpg?t=1753105783","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257171830,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171830/movie480.mp4?t=1753105781","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171830/movie_max.mp4?t=1753105781"},"name":"CONERU_A","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171830/a0f7aa5cc527014d79d9f5790561a36933948c5d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753105781","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171830/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753105781","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171830/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753105781"}},{"highlight":true,"id":25714